325	     attributes on <code>a</code> tags.
326	     </p>
327	     <p>
328	     To make an attribute invalid for <b>all tags</b>, use the pseudo tag <code>:all</code>, e.g.
329	     <code>removeAttributes(":all", "class")</code>.
330	     </p>
